      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amargosa_Valley%2C_Nevada"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Unlike most desert rivers, the Amargosa only runs on the surface during rare rains, except a 20‑mile stretch near Shoshone that flows year‑round.",
